PLAN-019 check 3 -- F104: the source of `s2_item` / `s2_tmpl`
SYNTHETIC / ARITHMETIC ONLY.  Not an experimental result.  results/ is empty.

[A1] one Bernoulli observation per item: profile logLik over s2_item
     one (task, coverage) cell, n_item = 400, observed correct_rate = 0.70
     (Go/No-Go #2 requires correct_rate >= 0.70 in every cell)
     s2_item    profiled mu  marginal p     logLik - max
     0.00       0.8473       0.700000       +0.000e+00
     0.25       0.8950       0.700000       +0.000e+00
     0.50       0.9388       0.700000       +0.000e+00
     1.00       1.0184       0.700000       +2.842e-14
     2.00       1.1563       0.700000       +0.000e+00
     4.00       1.3842       0.700000       +0.000e+00
     16.00      2.2950       0.700000       +0.000e+00
     -> the profile is FLAT: every s2_item fits exactly as well.
        `s2_item` is not identified from one observation per item.

[A2] r = 3 repeats at temperature 0 (task 5), every repeat agreeing
     logLik of the marginal model as s2_item grows; n_item = 400, 70% all-correct
     s2_item    profiled mu  logLik
     0.00       0.2824       -775.918
     0.50       0.3773       -671.549
     1.00       0.4582       -611.429
     2.00       0.5964       -540.905
